{"id":"huntik:page:16921","page_id":16921,"title":"Recover Void","kind":"supporting_page","namespace":0,"summary":"Recover Void was taken on by the Huntik team to retrieve the Amulet of Void in order to prevent the return of the Nullifiers. Having now learnt that Void was being stored in Klaus' bookshop, the team required Klaus' help to find it and thus turned him back to normal form. Despite Lok, Cherit and Springer beating Wilder and the Organization to the Amulet, the mission was thrown into disarray due to the arrival of the Blood Spiral and the return, Wind, Shauna and Rassimov. Although Dante was able to save him and the team by Powerbonding with Caliban, Shauna managed to snatch Void's Amulet from Lok. The Spirals then departed, burning Klaus' base to the ground in the process.","profile":{"name":{"text":"Recover Void","wikitext":"Recover Void","links":[]},"image":{"text":"File:Mission_Recover_Void.jpg","wikitext":"File:Mission_Recover_Void.jpg","links":[]},"city":{"text":"Vienna, Austria","wikitext":"[[Vienna, Austria]]","links":[{"target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_id":"huntik:page:8234","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"}]},"location":{"text":"Klaus' bookshop","wikitext":"[[Klaus' bookshop]]","links":[{"target_title":"Klaus' bookshop","label":"Klaus' bookshop","target_id":"huntik:page:18071","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus%27_bookshop","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A18071"}]},"members":{"text":"Dante Vale \n Lok Lambert \n Sophie Casterwill \n Zhalia Moon","wikitext":"[[Dante Vale]] <br> [[Lok Lambert]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]] <br> [[Zhalia Moon]]","links":[{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"