and the team by [[Powerbonding]] with [[Caliban]], Shauna managed to snatch Void's Amulet from Lok. The Spirals then departed, burning Klaus' base to the ground in the process. {{source|The Blood Spiral}}\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation Missions]]","categories":["Huntik Foundation Missions"],"links":[{"target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_id":"huntik:page:8234","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"},{"target_title":"Klaus' bookshop","label":"Klaus' bookshop","target_id":"huntik:page:18071","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus%27_bookshop","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A18071"},{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_id":"huntik:page:1983","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhalia Moon","target_id":"huntik:page:2000","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Zhalia_Moon","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2000"},{"target_title":"Klaus","label":"Klaus","target_id":"huntik:page:3241","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3241"},{"target_title":"Void","label":"Void","target_id":"huntik:page:4438","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Void","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4438"},{"target_title":"The Blood Spiral","label":"The Blood Spiral","target_id":"huntik:pag